msgid "The density functional program"
msgstr "密度泛函程序"

msgid ""
"Density-functional theory calculations may be performed using one of the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "密度泛函理论计算可使用以下命令之一执行："

msgid "``DFT`` calculate functional of a previously computed density."
msgstr "``DFT`` 计算先前计算密度的泛函。"

msgid ""
"Each of these commands may be qualified with the key-names of the "
"functional(s) which are to be used, and further options:"
msgstr "这些命令中的每一个都可以用要使用的泛函键名以及进一步的选项来限定："

msgid ""
"If no functional keyname is given, the default is ``LDA`` (see below). "
"Following this command may appear directives specifying options for the "
"density-functional modules (see section `directives "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#directives>`__) or the Hartree-Fock "
"program (see section `options <the_scf_program.html#options>`__)."
msgstr ""
"如果未给出泛函键名，则默认为 ``LDA``\\ （见下文）。在此命令之后可以出现指定密度泛函模块选项的指令（参见 `指令 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#directives>`__ 节）或 Hartree-Fock 程序选项（参见"
" `选项 <the_scf_program.html#options>`__ 节）。"

msgid ""
"On completion of the functional evaluation, or self-consistent Kohn-Sham "
"calculation, the values of the individual functionals are stored in the "
"Molpro vector variable ``DFTFUNS``; the total is in ``DFTFUN``, and the "
"corresponding individual functional names in ``DFTNAME``."
msgstr ""
"在泛函评估或自洽Kohn-Sham计算完成后，各个泛函的值存储在Molpro向量变量\\ ``DFTFUNS``\\ 中；总值存储在\\ "
"``DFTFUN``\\ 中，对应的各个泛函名称存储在\\ ``DFTNAME``\\ 中。"

msgid ""
"Energy gradients are available for self-consistent Kohn-Sham calculations."
msgstr "能量梯度可用于自洽Kohn-Sham计算。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"The following options may be specified on the ``KS`` or ``UKS`` command "
"lines:"
msgstr "以下选项可以在\\ ``KS``\\ 或\\ ``UKS``\\ 命令行中指定："

msgid ""
"In addition, all options valid for HF (see section `options "
"<the_scf_program.html#options>`__) can be given."
msgstr ""
"此外，所有对 HF 有效的选项（参见章节 `options <the_scf_program.html#options>`__\\ ）都可以给出。"

msgid "Directives"
msgstr "指令"

msgid "Density source (DENSITY, ODENSITY)"
msgstr "密度源 (DENSITY, ODENSITY)"

msgid ""
"For non-self-consistent ``DFT`` calculations, specifies the source of the "
"density matrix. The total density is read from *orbc.filec*, with further "
"options specifying density sets in the standard way as described in Section "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__. ``ODENSITY`` can be used to specify the spin density. "
"The defaults are the densities last written by an SCF or MCSCF program."
msgstr ""
"对于非自洽的 ``DFT`` 计算，指定密度矩阵的来源。总密度从 *orbc.filec* 读取，其他选项以标准方式指定密度集，如 `selecting"
" orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 节所述。\\ ``ODENSITY`` 可用于指定自旋密度。默认值为 SCF 或 MCSCF "
"程序最后写入的密度。"

msgid "Thresholds (DFTTHRESH)"
msgstr "阈值 (DFTTHRESH)"

msgid "Sets various truncation thresholds. *key* can be one of the following."
msgstr "设置各种截断阈值。\\ *key* 可以是以下之一。"

msgid "``ORBITAL`` Orbital truncation threshold."
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 轨道截断阈值。"

msgid "``DENSITY`` Density truncation threshold."
msgstr "``DENSITY`` 密度截断阈值。"

msgid "``FOCK`` Fock matrix truncation threshold."
msgstr "``FOCK`` Fock 矩阵截断阈值。"

msgid "Exact exchange computation (EXCHANGE)"
msgstr "精确交换计算 (EXCHANGE)"

msgid ""
"For Kohn-Sham calculations, compute exchange energy according to Hartree-"
"Fock formalism and add the contribution scaled by *factor* to the fock "
"matrix and the energy functional. Otherwise, the default is *factor=0*, "
"i.e., the exchange is assumed to be contained in the functional, and only "
"the Coulomb interaction is calculated explicitly."
msgstr ""
"对于 Kohn-Sham 计算，根据 Hartree-Fock 形式计算交换能，并将按 *factor* 缩放的贡献添加到 Fock "
"矩阵和能量泛函中。否则，默认值为 *factor=0*\\ ，即假定交换已包含在泛函中，仅显式计算库仑相互作用。"

msgid ""
"Provide a factor for each functional specified. The functionals will be "
"combined accordingly. By default, all factors are one."
msgstr "为每个指定的泛函提供一个因子。泛函将据此进行组合。默认情况下，所有因子均为 1。"

msgid "Double-hybrid functionals (DH, DSDH)"
msgstr "双杂化泛函（DH, DSDH）"

msgid ""
"initiates a density-scaled double-hybrid calculation (Ref. [2]) where "
":math:`a_x` is the fraction of HF exchange and :math:`a_c` is the fraction "
"of MP2 correlation. A self-consistent KS calculation is performed with "
"functional :math:`a_x E_x^{\\text{HF}} + (1-a_x) E_x^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] + "
"E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] - a_c E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho_{1/\\sqrt{a_c}}]`, "
"where :math:`\\rho_{1/\\sqrt{a_c}}` is the scaled density. In the case of "
"meta-GGA functionals, the kinetic energy density :math:`\\tau` is also "
"scaled, according to Ref. [3]. One then needs to call the MP2 program to add"
" the MP2 contribution :math:`a_c E_c^{\\text{MP2}}`. If :math:`a_c` is not "
"given, :math:`a_c=a_x^2` is assumed, according to Ref. [2]."
msgstr ""
"启动密度标度双杂化计算（参考文献[2]），其中 :math:`a_x` 是HF交换的比例，\\ :math:`a_c` 是MP2相关能的比例。使用泛函 "
":math:`a_x E_x^{\\text{HF}} + (1-a_x) E_x^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] + "
"E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] - a_c E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho_{1/\\sqrt{a_c}}]` "
"执行自洽KS计算，其中 :math:`\\rho_{1/\\sqrt{a_c}}` 是标度后的密度。对于meta-"
"GGA泛函，根据参考文献[3]，动能密度 :math:`\\tau` 也会被标度。然后需要调用MP2程序来添加MP2贡献 :math:`a_c "
"E_c^{\\text{MP2}}`\\ 。如果未给出 :math:`a_c`\\ ，则根据参考文献[2]假设 :math:`a_c=a_x^2`\\ "
"。"

msgid "Rangehybrid methods (RANGEHYBRID)"
msgstr "范围杂化方法 (RANGEHYBRID)"

msgid ""
"For coupling of short-range (sr-)DFT with long-range (lr-)ab-initio methods,"
" one first has to specify the coupling parameter :math:`\\mu` in the sr "
"interelectronic interaction :math:`\\sum_{i<j} {\\rm erf} (\\mu "
"r_{ij})/r_{ij}`; this can be done by setting a variable (e.g. ``mu=0.5``). "
"As a next step, long-range ERIs have to be calculated by calling the "
"integral program (e.g. ``int;erf,mu;``)."
msgstr ""
"要将短程 (sr-)DFT 与长程 (lr-)从头算方法进行耦合，首先需要在短程电子间相互作用 :math:`\\sum_{i<j} {\\rm "
"erf} (\\mu r_{ij})/r_{ij}` 中指定耦合参数 :math:`\\mu`\\ ；这可以通过设置一个变量来完成（例如 "
"``mu=0.5``\\ ）。下一步，必须通过调用积分程序（例如 ``int;erf,mu;``\\ ）来计算长程电子排斥积分。"

msgid ""
"Then sr-DFT/lr-HF calculations can be performed by calling the RKS program "
"with the additional subcommand ``rangehybrid``. Available short-range "
"functionals are ``exerf`` and ``ecerf`` for sr-LDA, and ``exerfpbe`` and "
"``ecerfpbe`` for sr-PBE; as usual, the functionals have to be specified "
"after the ``rks`` command (e.g. ``rks,exerf,ecerf;``). The underlying short-"
"range LDA correlation functional is that of S. Paziani, S. Moroni, P. Gori-"
"Giorgi, G.B. Bachelet, `Phys. Rev. B "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.73.155111>`__ **73**, 155111 (2006)."
msgstr ""
"然后，可以通过调用 RKS 程序并附加子命令 ``rangehybrid`` 来执行 sr-DFT/lr-HF 计算。可用的短程泛函有用于 sr-LDA"
" 的 ``exerf`` 和 ``ecerf``\\ ，以及用于 sr-PBE 的 ``exerfpbe`` 和 ``ecerfpbe``\\ "
"；与通常一样，泛函必须在 ``rks`` 命令后指定（例如 ``rks,exerf,ecerf;``\\ ）。其基础的短程 LDA 相关泛函来自 S. "
"Paziani, S. Moroni, P. Gori-Giorgi, G.B. Bachelet, `Phys. Rev. B "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.73.155111>`__ **73**, 155111 (2006)。"

msgid ""
"Finally, sr-DFT/lr-post-HF calculations can be done by adding, within a call"
" of the chosen post-HF program, two subcommands: ``srxcdft`` followed by the"
" desired short-range functionals (e.g. ``srxcdft,exerf,ecerf;``), and "
"``dftden`` followed by the record number from which the density for the sr "
"functionals is taken. Implementations are available for ``ci``, ``mp2``, "
"``ccsd``, ``ccsd(t)``, ``rpatddft``, and the corresponding local MP2 and CC "
"methods w/wo density-fitting."
msgstr ""
"最后，sr-DFT/lr-后 HF 计算可以通过在所选后 HF 程序的调用中添加两个子命令来完成：\\ ``srxcdft`` 后跟所需的短程泛函（例如"
" ``srxcdft,exerf,ecerf;``\\ ），以及 ``dftden`` 后跟从中获取短程泛函所用密度的记录号。该实现可用于 "
"``ci``\\ 、\\ ``mp2``\\ 、\\ ``ccsd``\\ 、\\ ``ccsd(t)``\\ 、\\ ``rpatddft``\\ "
"，以及相应的局域 MP2 和 CC 方法（带或不带密度拟合）。"

msgid ""
"Example of a RSDH calculation with the approximation 4 of Ref. [1] for the "
"short-range density functional:"
msgstr "使用参考文献[1]中近似4进行短程密度泛函的RSDH计算示例："

msgid ""
"Note that the ``erflerfc`` option to the integral program can be used to "
"calculate arbitrary mixtures of short-range and long-range Coulomb repulsion"
" integrals via, e.g.,"
msgstr "请注意，积分程序的\\ ``erflerfc``\\ 选项可用于计算短程和长程库仑排斥积分的任意混合，例如，"

msgid ""
"which corresponds to the interaction operator "
":math:`\\mbox{lr}\\cdot\\frac{\\mbox{erf}(\\mu r_{12})}{r_{12}} + "
"\\mbox{sr}\\cdot\\frac{\\mbox{erfc}(\\mu r_{12})}{r_{12}}`. Setting ``lr=1``"
" and ``sr=1`` would therefore mean that Molpro will calculate the full-range"
" Coulomb integrals."
msgstr ""
"这对应于相互作用算符 :math:`\\mbox{lr}\\cdot\\frac{\\mbox{erf}(\\mu r_{12})}{r_{12}} +"
" \\mbox{sr}\\cdot\\frac{\\mbox{erfc}(\\mu r_{12})}{r_{12}}`\\ 。因此，设置\\ "
"``lr=1``\\ 和\\ ``sr=1``\\ 将意味着Molpro将计算全范围的库仑积分。"

msgid "Exchange-correlation potential (POTENTIAL)"
msgstr "交换-相关势 (POTENTIAL)"

msgid ""
"For stand-alone DFT calculations, compute exchange-correlation potential "
"pseudo-matrix elements, defined formally as the differential of the sum of "
"all specified functionals with respect to elements of the atomic orbital "
"density matrix. The matrix is written to record *rec* on file *fil*."
msgstr ""
"对于独立的DFT计算，计算交换-相关势的伪矩阵元，其形式定义为所有指定泛函之和相对于原子轨道密度矩阵元的微分。该矩阵被写入文件 *fil* 的记录 "
"*rec* 中。"

msgid "Grid blocking factor (DFTBLOCK)"
msgstr "网格分块因子 (DFTBLOCK)"

msgid ""
"Respecify the number of spatial integration points treated together as a "
"block in the DFT integration routines (default 128). Increasing *nblock* may"
" enhance efficiency on, e.g., vector architectures, but leads to increased "
"memory usage."
msgstr ""
"重新指定在DFT积分例程中作为一个块一起处理的空间积分点数量（默认128）。增加 *nblock* "
"可能会提高效率（例如，在向量架构上），但会导致内存使用增加。"

msgid "Dump integrand values(DFTDUMP)"
msgstr "转储被积函数值(DFTDUMP)"

msgid ""
"Write out values of the integrand at grid points to the file *file*. The "
"first line of *file* contains the number of functional components; there "
"then follows a line for each functional giving the input key of the "
"functional. Subsequent lines give the functional number, cartesian "
"coordinates, integrand value and integration weight with Fortran format "
"``(I2,3F15.10,F23.15)``."
msgstr ""
"将网格点处的被积函数值输出到文件 *file*\\ 。文件 *file* "
"的第一行包含泛函组件的数量；随后每行对应一个泛函，给出该泛函的输入键。后续行给出泛函编号、笛卡尔坐标、被积函数值和积分权重，格式为 Fortran 格式"
" ``(I2,3F15.10,F23.15)``\\ 。"

msgid "Asymptotic correction for xc-potentials(ASYMP)"
msgstr "xc-势的渐近校正(ASYMP)"

msgid ""
"Activates the gradient-regulated asymptotic correction (GRAC) approach for "
"exchange-correlation potentials of Grüning *et al.* (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1327260>`__ **114**, 652 (2001)). The user has"
" to supply a *shift* parameter (:math:`\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}`) for the bulk "
"potential which should approximate the difference between the HOMO energy "
"(:math:`\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}`) obtained from the respective standard "
"Kohn-Sham calculation and the (negative) ionisation potential of the monomer"
" (:math:`\\text{IP}`):"
msgstr ""
"激活 Grüning *等人* (`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1327260>`__ "
"**114**, 652 (2001)) 提出的交换-相关势的梯度调节渐近校正 (GRAC) 方法。用户需要为体势提供一个 *shift* 参数 "
"(:math:`\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}`)，该参数应近似等于从相应标准 Kohn-Sham 计算获得的 HOMO 能量 "
"(:math:`\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}`) 与单体（负）电离势 (:math:`\\text{IP}`) 之间的差值："

msgid "\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}=\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}-(-\\text{IP})"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}=\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}-(-\\text{IP})\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"This method accounts for the derivative discontinuity of the exact xc-"
"potential and that is missing in approximate ones. The parameters "
":math:`\\alpha` and :math:`\\beta` determine the interpolation function (see"
" Eq. (2.3) in the above reference) and are set to :math:`\\alpha=0.5` and "
":math:`\\beta=40` by default, respectively. The parameter *b* is the "
"parameter of the asymptotic xc-potential from van Leeuwen and Baerends "
"(`Phys. Rev. A <https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.49.2421>`__ **49**, 2421"
" (1994), Eqns. (54,55)) and is set to *b*\\ =0.05 by default."
msgstr ""
"\\ 此方法考虑了精确 xc-势的导数不连续性，而这一点在近似势中是缺失的。参数 :math:`\\alpha` 和 :math:`\\beta` "
"决定了插值函数（参见上述参考文献中的 Eq. (2.3)），默认值分别设为 :math:`\\alpha=0.5` 和 "
":math:`\\beta=40`\\ 。参数 *b* 是来自 van Leeuwen 和 Baerends (`Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.49.2421>`__ **49**, 2421 (1994), Eqns. "
"(54,55)) 的渐近 xc-势的参数，默认设为 *b*\\ =0.05。"

msgid ""
"In case of gradient or laplacian functionals the modified GRAC scheme of "
"Bast *et al.* (Chem. Phys. Chem. **9**, 445 (2008)) is used."
msgstr ""
"对于梯度或拉普拉斯泛函，使用 Bast *等人* (Chem. Phys. Chem. **9**, 445 (2008)) 的改进 GRAC 方案。"

msgid ""
"If *shift* is set to zero in the input the program will estimate the "
"ionisation energy from the HOMO energy during the SCF (as soon as the HOMO "
"energy is converged to a given threshold) and then sets the bulk shift "
"automatically. This is done by using a linear fit of DFT HOMO energies to "
"ionisation energies calculated with the :math:`\\Delta`\\ SCF method for a "
"range of molecules (see also S. Hirata *et al.*, J. Phys. Chem. A, **107**, "
"10154 (2003))."
msgstr ""
"如果在输入中将 *shift* 设置为零，程序将在 SCF 过程中根据 HOMO 能量估算电离能（一旦 HOMO "
"能量收敛到给定阈值），然后自动设置体相位移。这是通过使用一系列分子的 DFT HOMO 能量与通过 :math:`\\Delta`\\ SCF "
"方法计算的电离能进行线性拟合来实现的（另见 S. Hirata *等人*\\ ，J. Phys. Chem. A, **107**, 10154 "
"(2003)）。"

msgid "Testing the xc functional implementation (DFTTEST)"
msgstr "测试 xc 泛函实现 (DFTTEST)"

msgid ""
"Using the directive ``DFTTEST`` it is possible to test the xc potential "
"matrix elements against numerical derivatives. For this, use"
msgstr "使用指令 ``DFTTEST`` 可以测试 xc 势矩阵元与数值导数的对比。为此，使用"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to compute the overlap matrix (and thus the electron "
"number) within the DFT program. For this the test functional ``STEST`` has "
"to be used (as the only functional on the input):"
msgstr "也可以在 DFT 程序中计算重叠矩阵（从而计算电子数）。为此，必须使用测试泛函 ``STEST``\\ （作为输入中唯一的泛函）："

msgid ""
"The additional directive ``dfttest,0`` also will print a list of the overlap"
" matrix elements and ``dfttest,1`` will, again, also test the functional "
"derivatives. This test is useful to investigate the accuracy of the "
"quadrature grid, see section `numerical integration grid control (GRID) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__."
msgstr ""
"附加指令 ``dfttest,0`` 也会打印重叠矩阵元的列表，而 ``dfttest,1`` "
"将再次测试泛函导数。此测试有助于研究求积网格的精度，参见章节 `数值积分网格控制 (GRID) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Numerical integration grid control (GRID)"
msgstr "数值积分网格控制 (GRID)"

msgid ""
"Density functionals are evaluated through numerical quadrature on a grid in "
"three-dimensional space. Although the sensible defaults will usually "
"suffice, the parameters that define the grid can be specified by using the "
"``GRID`` command, which should be presented *before* the ``DFT`` or ``KS`` "
"commands that will use the grid, but after the geometry definition. "
"Typically, the input file then could look like"
msgstr ""
"密度泛函通过在三维空间的网格上进行数值求积来评估。尽管合理的默认值通常足够，但可以通过使用 ``GRID`` "
"命令来指定定义网格的参数，该命令应出现在将使用该网格的 ``DFT`` 或 ``KS`` 命令 *之前*\\ "
"，但在几何定义之后。通常，输入文件可能如下所示"

msgid ""
"Note that then, however, the modifications to the grid parameters are only "
"applied during the KS calculation but they are reset to their default state "
"afterwards. Also note that the directives which are available for ``GRID`` "
"can not be used with ``KS``, so these can be exclusively only used for "
"``GRID``. The grid parameters are stored internally on a record whose "
"location can be changed by"
msgstr ""
"但请注意，在这种情况下，对网格参数的修改仅在 KS 计算期间应用，之后它们会重置为默认状态。另请注意，\\ ``GRID`` 可用的指令不能与 "
"``KS`` 一起使用，因此这些指令只能专门用于 ``GRID``\\ 。网格参数内部存储在一个记录上，该记录的位置可以通过以下方式更改："

msgid ""
"By default Molpro uses the record *orb.file* = 1800.2 to store the grid "
"parameters that are independent of the geometry. The information on disk "
"consists of two parts: the parameters necessary to define the grid (record "
"on file 2), and a cache of the evaluated grid points and weights "
"(corresponding record on file 1, usually 1800.1). The latter is flagged as "
"‘dirty’ whenever any parameters are changed, and whenever the geometry "
"changes; if the cache is dirty, then when an attempt is made to use the "
"grid, it will be recalculated, otherwise the cached values are used."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Molpro 使用记录 *orb.file* = 1800.2 "
"来存储与几何结构无关的网格参数。磁盘上的信息由两部分组成：定义网格所需的参数（文件 2 上的记录），以及已评估网格点和权重的缓存（文件 1 "
"上的对应记录，通常为 "
"1800.1）。每当任何参数更改时，以及每当几何结构更改时，后者会被标记为“脏”；如果缓存是脏的，那么当尝试使用网格时，它将重新计算，否则将使用缓存的值。"

msgid ""
"If *status* is ``OLD``, an attempt to restore the grid from a previous "
"calculation is performed; effectively, the old grid provides a template of "
"parameters which can be adjusted using the parameter commands described "
"below. If *status* is ``NEW``, the grid is always created with default "
"parameters. If *status* is ``UNKNOWN`` (the default), a new grid is created "
"if record *orb.file* does not exist; otherwise the old grid is used."
msgstr ""
"如果 *status* 是 ``OLD``\\ "
"，则会尝试从先前的计算中恢复网格；实际上，旧网格提供了一个参数模板，可以使用下面描述的参数命令进行调整。如果 *status* 是 ``NEW``\\ "
"，则始终使用默认参数创建网格。如果 *status* 是 ``UNKNOWN``\\ （默认值），则如果记录 *orb.file* "
"不存在，则创建新网格；否则使用旧网格。"

msgid ""
