msgid "Technical definitions of density functional inputs"
msgstr "密度泛函输入的技术定义"

msgid ""
"In the following, :math:`\\rho_\\alpha` and :math:`\\rho_\\beta` are the "
":math:`\\alpha` and :math:`\\beta` spin densities; the total spin density is"
" :math:`\\rho`;"
msgstr ""
"在下文中，\\ :math:`\\rho_\\alpha` 和 :math:`\\rho_\\beta` 分别是 :math:`\\alpha` 和 "
":math:`\\beta` 自旋密度；总自旋密度为 :math:`\\rho`\\ ；"

msgid "The gradients of the density enter through"
msgstr "密度的梯度通过以下方式引入"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha} &=& \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\; ,\n"
"\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta} = \\nabla\\rho_\\beta \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\beta\\; ,\n"
"\\sigma _{\\alpha\\beta}= \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\beta \\; , \\nonumber\n"
"\\\\\n"
"\\sigma &=& \\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha}+\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta}+2\\sigma _{\\alpha\\beta}.\n"
"\\\\\n"
"\\chi_\\alpha&=& \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha}}}{\\rho_\\alpha^{4/3}}\\;,\n"
"\\chi_\\beta = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta}}}{\\rho_\\beta^{4/3}}\\;.\\\\\n"
"\\upsilon_\\alpha&=&\\nabla^2\\rho_\\alpha \\; ,\n"
"\\upsilon_\\beta=\\nabla^2\\rho_\\beta \\; ,\n"
"\\upsilon=\\upsilon_\\alpha+\\upsilon_\\beta \\;.\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha} &=& \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\; ,\n"
"\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta} = \\nabla\\rho_\\beta \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\beta\\; ,\n"
"\\sigma _{\\alpha\\beta}= \\nabla\\rho_\\alpha \\cdot \\nabla\\rho_\\beta \\; , \\nonumber\n"
"\\\\\n"
"\\sigma &=& \\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha}+\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta}+2\\sigma _{\\alpha\\beta}.\n"
"\\\\\n"
"\\chi_\\alpha&=& \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{\\alpha\\alpha}}}{\\rho_\\alpha^{4/3}}\\;,\n"
"\\chi_\\beta = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{\\beta\\beta}}}{\\rho_\\beta^{4/3}}\\;.\\\\\n"
"\\upsilon_\\alpha&=&\\nabla^2\\rho_\\alpha \\; ,\n"
"\\upsilon_\\beta=\\nabla^2\\rho_\\beta \\; ,\n"
"\\upsilon=\\upsilon_\\alpha+\\upsilon_\\beta \\;.\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"Additionally, the kinetic energy density for a set of (Kohn-Sham) orbitals "
"generating the density can be introduced through"
msgstr "\\ 此外，可以通过以下方式引入一组生成密度的（Kohn-Sham）轨道的动能密度"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\tau_\\alpha&=&\\sum_i^\\alpha\n"
"\\left|{\\bf\\nabla}\\phi_i\\right|^2\n"
"\\; , \\tau_\\beta=\\sum_i^\\beta\n"
"\\left|{\\bf\\nabla}\\phi_i\\right|^2\n"
"\\;,\n"
"\\tau=\\tau_\\alpha+\\tau_\\beta \\;.\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\tau_\\alpha&=&\\sum_i^\\alpha\n"
"\\left|{\\bf\\nabla}\\phi_i\\right|^2\n"
"\\; , \\tau_\\beta=\\sum_i^\\beta\n"
"\\left|{\\bf\\nabla}\\phi_i\\right|^2\n"
"\\;,\n"
"\\tau=\\tau_\\alpha+\\tau_\\beta \\;.\\end{aligned}"

msgid "All of the available functionals are of the general form"
msgstr "所有可用的泛函都具有以下一般形式"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"F\\left[\\rho_s,\\rho_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\sigma_{ss},\\sigma_{\\bar{s}\\bar{s}},\\sigma_{s\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\tau_s,\\tau_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\upsilon_s,\\upsilon_{\\bar{s}}\n"
"\\right] &=&\n"
"\\int d^3{\\bf r}\n"
"K\\left(\\rho_s,\\rho_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\sigma_{ss},\\sigma_{\\bar{s}\\bar{s}},\\sigma_{s\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\tau_s,\\tau_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\upsilon_s,\\upsilon_{\\bar{s}}\n"
"\\right)\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"F\\left[\\rho_s,\\rho_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\sigma_{ss},\\sigma_{\\bar{s}\\bar{s}},\\sigma_{s\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\tau_s,\\tau_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\upsilon_s,\\upsilon_{\\bar{s}}\n"
"\\right] &=&\n"
"\\int d^3{\\bf r}\n"
"K\\left(\\rho_s,\\rho_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\sigma_{ss},\\sigma_{\\bar{s}\\bar{s}},\\sigma_{s\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\tau_s,\\tau_{\\bar{s}},\n"
"\\upsilon_s,\\upsilon_{\\bar{s}}\n"
"\\right)\\end{aligned}"

msgid "where :math:`\\bar{s}` is the conjugate spin to :math:`s`."
msgstr "\\ 其中 :math:`\\bar{s}` 是 :math:`s` 的共轭自旋。"

msgid "Lists of component density functionals"
msgstr "分量密度泛函列表"

msgid ""
"Below is a list of the primary correlation and exchange functionals "
"supported by Molpro. These can be combined into total density functionals. "
"For example, the following input will produce a B3LYP calculation:"
msgstr "以下是 Molpro 支持的主要相关和交换泛函列表。这些可以组合成总密度泛函。例如，以下输入将执行 B3LYP 计算："

msgid ""
"``{dfunc,B88,DIRAC,LYP,VWN5,dftfac=[0.72,0.08,0.81,0.19],exfac=0.2}{df-"
"rks}``"
msgstr ""
"``{dfunc,B88,DIRAC,LYP,VWN5,dftfac=[0.72,0.08,0.81,0.19],exfac=0.2}{df-"
"rks}``"

msgid ""
"Note that many commonly used combinations of primary functionals are "
"predefined as alias keywords (e.g., ``{df-rks,b3lyp}`` is an equivalent "
"input. See above)."
msgstr "请注意，许多常用的基本泛函组合已预定义为别名关键字（例如，\\ ``{df-rks,b3lyp}`` 是等效的输入。参见上文）。"

msgid "K=\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_s \\rho_s U_s"
msgstr ""
"K=\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_s \\rho_s U_s\n"
","

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid "U_s=-(1-e^{-x}-xe^{-x}/2)/b"
msgstr ""
"U_s=-(1-e^{-x}-xe^{-x}/2)/b\n"
","

msgid "b=\\frac{x^3e^{-x}}{8\\pi\\rho_s}"
msgstr ""
"b=\\frac{x^3e^{-x}}{8\\pi\\rho_s}\n"
"\n"

msgid "and :math:`x` is defined by the nonlinear equation"
msgstr "且 :math:`x` 由非线性方程定义"

msgid "\\frac{xe^{-2x/3}}{x-2}=\\frac{2\\pi^{2/3}\\rho_s^{5/3}}{3Q_s}"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{xe^{-2x/3}}{x-2}=\\frac{2\\pi^{2/3}\\rho_s^{5/3}}{3Q_s}\n"
","

msgid "Q_s=(\\upsilon_s-2\\gamma D_s)/6"
msgstr ""
"Q_s=(\\upsilon_s-2\\gamma D_s)/6\n"
","

msgid "D_s=\\tau_s-\\frac{\\sigma_{ss}}{4\\rho_s}"
msgstr ""
"D_s=\\tau_s-\\frac{\\sigma_{ss}}{4\\rho_s}\n"
"\n"

msgid "\\gamma=1."
msgstr ""
"\\gamma=1.\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"``BRUEG`` Becke-Roussel Exchange Functional — Uniform Electron Gas Limit. A."
" D. Becke and M. R. Roussel,\\ `Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.39.3761>`__ **39**, 3761 (1989) As for "
"``BR`` but with :math:`{\\gamma=0.8}`."
msgstr ""
"``BRUEG`` Becke-Roussel 交换泛函——均匀电子气极限。A. D. Becke 和 M. R. Roussel，\\ `Phys. "
"Rev. A <https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.39.3761>`__ **39**, 3761 (1989) "
"与 ``BR`` 相同，但 :math:`{\\gamma=0.8}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``CS1`` Colle-Salvetti correlation functional. R. Colle and O. Salvetti, "
"Theor. Chim. Acta 37, 329 (1974); C. Lee, W. Yang and R. G. Parr, `Phys. "
"Rev. B <https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.37.785>`__ **37**, 785(1988) "
"``CS1`` is formally identical to ``CS2``, except for a reformulation in "
"which the terms involving :math:`\\upsilon` are eliminated by integration by"
" parts. This makes the functional more economical to evaluate. In the limit "
"of exact quadrature, ``CS1`` and ``CS2`` are identical, but small numerical "
"differences appear with finite integration grids."
msgstr ""
"``CS1`` Colle-Salvetti 相关泛函。R. Colle 和 O. Salvetti, Theor. Chim. Acta 37, "
"329 (1974); C. Lee, W. Yang 和 R. G. Parr, `Phys. Rev. B "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.37.785>`__ **37**, 785(1988) ``CS1`` "
"在形式上与 ``CS2`` 相同，只是通过分部积分消除了涉及 :math:`\\upsilon` "
"的项。这使得泛函的计算更加经济。在精确求积的极限下，\\ ``CS1`` 和 ``CS2`` 是相同的，但在有限积分网格下会出现微小的数值差异。"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  K &=&\n"
"  -a \\left({\n"
"  \\rho+2b\\rho^{-5/3}\n"
"  \\left[\n"
"  \\rho_\\alpha t_{\\alpha} + \\rho_\\beta t_{\\beta}\n"
"  -\\rho t_W\n"
"  \\right]\n"
"  e^{-c\\rho^{-1/3}}\n"
"  \\over 1+d \\rho^{-1/3}\n"
"  }\\right)\n"
"  \\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  K &=&\n"
"  -a \\left({\n"
"  \\rho+2b\\rho^{-5/3}\n"
"  \\left[\n"
"  \\rho_\\alpha t_{\\alpha} + \\rho_\\beta t_{\\beta}\n"
"  -\\rho t_W\n"
"  \\right]\n"
"  e^{-c\\rho^{-1/3}}\n"
"  \\over 1+d \\rho^{-1/3}\n"
"  }\\right)\n"
"  \\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  t_{\\alpha} &=&\\frac{\\tau_\\alpha}{2}-\\frac{\\upsilon_\\alpha}{8}\n"
"  \\\\\n"
"  t_{\\beta} &=&\\frac{\\tau_\\beta}{2}-\\frac{\\upsilon_\\beta}{8}\n"
"  \\\\\n"
"  t_{W} &=& {1\\over 8} {\\sigma \\over \\rho} - {1\\over 2} \\upsilon\n"
"  \\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  t_{\\alpha} &=&\\frac{\\tau_\\alpha}{2}-\\frac{\\upsilon_\\alpha}{8}\n"
"  \\\\\n"
"  t_{\\beta} &=&\\frac{\\tau_\\beta}{2}-\\frac{\\upsilon_\\beta}{8}\n"
"  \\\\\n"
"  t_{W} &=& {1\\over 8} {\\sigma \\over \\rho} - {1\\over 2} \\upsilon\n"
"  \\end{aligned}"

msgid "and the constants are :math:`a=0.04918, b=0.132, c=0.2533, d=0.349`."
msgstr "常数为 :math:`a=0.04918, b=0.132, c=0.2533, d=0.349`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& &\n"
"\\epsilon_c^{\\rm SR}(r_s,\\zeta,\\mu)  =  \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}(r_s,\\zeta)-\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"& & \\frac{[\\phi_2(\\zeta)]^3Q\\left(\\frac{\\mu\\sqrt{r_s}}{\\phi_2(\\zeta)}\\right)+a_1 \\mu^3+a_2 \\mu^4+\n"
" a_3\\mu^5+a_4\\mu^6+a_5\\mu^8}{(1+b_0^2\\mu^2)^4},\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& &\n"
"\\epsilon_c^{\\rm SR}(r_s,\\zeta,\\mu)  =  \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}(r_s,\\zeta)-\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"& & \\frac{[\\phi_2(\\zeta)]^3Q\\left(\\frac{\\mu\\sqrt{r_s}}{\\phi_2(\\zeta)}\\right)+a_1 \\mu^3+a_2 \\mu^4+\n"
" a_3\\mu^5+a_4\\mu^6+a_5\\mu^8}{(1+b_0^2\\mu^2)^4},\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"Q(x)=\\frac{2\\ln(2)-2}{\\pi^2}\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+a\\,x+b\\,x^2+c\\,x^3}{1+a\\,x+\n"
"d\\,x^2}\\right),"
msgstr ""
"Q(x)=\\frac{2\\ln(2)-2}{\\pi^2}\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+a\\,x+b\\,x^2+c\\,x^3}{1+a\\,x+\n"
"d\\,x^2}\\right),"

msgid ""
"with :math:`a=5.84605`, :math:`c=3.91744`, :math:`d=3.44851`, and "
":math:`b=d-3\\pi\\alpha/(4\\ln(2)-4)`. The parameters "
":math:`a_i(r_s,\\zeta)` are given by"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`a=5.84605`, :math:`c=3.91744`, :math:`d=3.44851`, 且 "
":math:`b=d-3\\pi\\alpha/(4\\ln(2)-4)`\\ 。参数 :math:`a_i(r_s,\\zeta)` 由下式给出"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"a_1 & = & 4 \\,b_0^6 \\,C_3+b_0^8 \\,C_5, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_2 & = & 4 \\,b_0^6 \\,C_2+b_0^8\\, C_4+6\\, b_0^4 \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_3 & = & b_0^8 \\,C_3, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_4 & = & b_0^8 \\,C_2+4 \\,b_0^6\\, \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92} \\nonumber, \\\\\n"
"a_5 & = & b_0^8\\,\\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}, \\nonumber\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"a_1 & = & 4 \\,b_0^6 \\,C_3+b_0^8 \\,C_5, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_2 & = & 4 \\,b_0^6 \\,C_2+b_0^8\\, C_4+6\\, b_0^4 \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_3 & = & b_0^8 \\,C_3, \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"a_4 & = & b_0^8 \\,C_2+4 \\,b_0^6\\, \\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92} \\nonumber, \\\\\n"
"a_5 & = & b_0^8\\,\\epsilon_c^{\\rm PW92}, \\nonumber\\end{aligned}"

msgid "with"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_2 & = & -\\frac{3(1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)\\,g_c(0,r_s,\\zeta\\!=\\!0)}{8\\,r_s^3} \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_3 & = &  - (1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)\\frac{g(0,r_s,\\zeta\\!=\\!0)}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\, r_s^3}\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_4 & = & -\\frac{9\\, c_4(r_s,\\zeta)}{64 r_s^3} \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_5 & =  & -\\frac{9\\, c_5(r_s,\\zeta)}{40\\sqrt{2 \\pi} r_s^3}\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"c_4(r_s,\\zeta)\n"
"& = & \\left(\\frac{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)+ \\left(\\frac{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2 \\times \\nonumber  \\\\ & & g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)\n"
"+ (1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)D_2(r_s)-\\frac{\\phi_8(\\zeta)}{5\\,\\alpha^2\\,r_s^2}\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"c_5(r_s,\\zeta)\n"
"& = & \\left(\\frac{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)+\n"
"  \\left(\\frac{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2 \\times \\nonumber \\\\  & & g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)+  (1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)D_3(r_s),\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_2 & = & -\\frac{3(1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)\\,g_c(0,r_s,\\zeta\\!=\\!0)}{8\\,r_s^3} \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_3 & = &  - (1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)\\frac{g(0,r_s,\\zeta\\!=\\!0)}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\, r_s^3}\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_4 & = & -\\frac{9\\, c_4(r_s,\\zeta)}{64 r_s^3} \\nonumber \\\\\n"
"C_5 & =  & -\\frac{9\\, c_5(r_s,\\zeta)}{40\\sqrt{2 \\pi} r_s^3}\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"c_4(r_s,\\zeta)\n"
"& = & \\left(\\frac{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)+ \\left(\\frac{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2 \\times \\nonumber  \\\\ & & g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)\n"
"+ (1\\!-\\!\\zeta^2)D_2(r_s)-\\frac{\\phi_8(\\zeta)}{5\\,\\alpha^2\\,r_s^2}\n"
"\\nonumber \\\\\n"
"c_5(r_s,\\zeta)\n"
"& = & \\left(\\frac{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2g''\\left(0,\n"
"r_s\\left(\\frac{2}{1\\!+\\!\\zeta}\\right)^{1/3}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!, \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\zeta\\!=\\!1\\right)+\n"
"  \\left(\\frac{1\\!-\\!\\zeta}{2}\\right)^2 \\times \\nonumber \\\\  & & g''\\left(0,\n"
