msgid ""
"As an example the Perdew-Wang 1991 GGA exchange functional is given below:"
msgstr "例如，Perdew-Wang 1991 GGA 交换泛函如下所示："

msgid "Note on Minnesota Density Functionals"
msgstr "关于明尼苏达密度泛函的说明"

msgid ""
"It has been observed by Mardirossian and Head-Gordon that several density "
"functionals from the Minnesota group, including M06, M11, M06-L, M06-HF and "
"M11-L, exhibit a very slow convergence of intermolecular interaction "
"energies with respect to the basis set, see `JCTC 9 (2013) 4453 "
"<https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/ct400660j>`__. Apparently, this problem "
"can not be cured by larger integration grids and originates from a "
"contribution to the exchange enhancement factor whose shape can strongly "
"depend on the chosen basis set. Based on these observations it is "
"recommended to use basis sets which were originally employed to develop "
"these functionals."
msgstr ""
"Mardirossian 和 Head-Gordon 观察到，明尼苏达小组的几种密度泛函，包括 M06、M11、M06-L、M06-HF 和 "
"M11-L，其分子间相互作用能相对于基组的收敛速度非常缓慢，参见 `JCTC 9 (2013) 4453 "
"<https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/ct400660j>`__\\ "
"。显然，这个问题无法通过更大的积分网格来解决，其根源在于对交换增强因子的一个贡献，该贡献的形状可能强烈依赖于所选的基组。基于这些观察，建议使用最初用于开发这些泛函的基组。"

msgid ""
"The MK00 and MK00B functionals (termed MGGA_X_MK00 and MGGA_X_MK00B in "
"LibXC) `J. Chem. Phys. 112, 7002–7007 (2000) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.481298>`__ should better not be used in general "
"calculations with Molpro due to the problem that the denominators "
":math:`\\tau-\\upsilon/4` in the functional can be zero or even turn "
"negative, producing unphysical results."
msgstr ""
"MK00 和 MK00B 泛函（在 LibXC 中称为 MGGA_X_MK00 和 MGGA_X_MK00B）\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"112, 7002–7007 (2000) <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.481298>`__ 最好不要在 Molpro "
"的一般计算中使用，因为泛函中的分母 :math:`\\tau-\\upsilon/4` 可能为零甚至变为负值，从而产生非物理结果。"

msgid "Implementing new hybrid-functionals"
msgstr "实现新的杂化泛函"

msgid ""
"Hybrid functionals are defined in the file ``lib/dalias.registry``. Entries "
"can be added to this file as required, and then run ``make`` to update the "
"other registry files."
msgstr ""
"杂化泛函在文件 ``lib/dalias.registry`` 中定义。可以根据需要向该文件添加条目，然后运行 ``make`` 以更新其他注册文件。"

msgid "Exact exchange Kohn-Sham methods"
msgstr "精确交换 Kohn-Sham 方法"

msgid ""
"Note that (almost) all methods described in this section can **only be run "
"without using symmetry**. Furthermore, for most of the approaches also no "
"open-shell implementation is available."
msgstr "请注意，本节描述的（几乎）所有方法\\ **只能在未使用对称性的情况下运行**\\ 。此外，对于大多数方法，也没有开壳层实现可用。"

msgid "Local Hartree-Fock (LHF) method"
msgstr "局域 Hartree-Fock (LHF) 方法"

msgid ""
"The LHF method is an *approximate* exact exchange KS method which derives "
"the local exchange potential by starting from the assumption that the HF and"
" the exchange-only KS determinants are identical, see Ref. [1]. An advantage"
" of the method is that the approach always yields smooth and physically "
"correct potentials (cf. the next section and Refs. [3,4]). A disadvantage of"
" the LHF method is that the potential has to be computed on a numerical grid"
" which can be quite costly, particularly due to the fact that the Slater "
"potential contribution to :math:`v_{\\text{x}}` requires a computation of "
"the electrostatic potential of the product of two AO basis functions on the "
"grid [1]. The use of the density-fitting approach of Ref. [2], however, "
"significantly reduces this cost, see below."
msgstr ""
"LHF 方法是一种\\ *近似*\\ 的精确交换 KS 方法，它通过从 HF 行列式与仅交换 KS 行列式相同的假设出发，推导出局域交换势，参见文献 "
"[1]。该方法的一个优点是总能产生平滑且物理正确的势（参见下一节及文献 [3,4]）。LHF "
"方法的一个缺点是势必须在数值格点上计算，这可能相当耗时，特别是由于 :math:`v_{\\text{x}}` 中的 Slater "
"势贡献需要在格点上计算两个原子轨道基组函数乘积的静电势 [1]。然而，使用文献 [2] 的密度拟合方法可显著降低此成本，详见下文。"

msgid ""
"The LHF functional is only implemented for closed-shell systems in Molpro. "
"No point group symmetry can be used in both iterative and non-iterative "
"(T)LHF calculations."
msgstr "LHF 泛函在 Molpro 中仅针对闭壳层体系实现。在迭代和非迭代 (T)LHF 计算中均不能使用点群对称性。"

msgid ""
"A standard LHF calculation with Molpro can be performed with the Kohn-Sham "
"DFT program using"
msgstr "使用 Molpro 进行标准 LHF 计算可通过 Kohn-Sham DFT 程序实现，使用"

msgid ""
"During the SCF iterations, the program prints out the HOMO eigenvalue and "
"the Slater exchange energy which should be identical to the exact exchange "
"energy. It is always good to check in the output that the latter holds true."
msgstr "在 SCF 迭代过程中，程序会输出 HOMO 本征值和 Slater 交换能，后者应与精确交换能相同。在输出中检查后者是否成立总是有益的。"

msgid "The following options can be used with the LHF program:"
msgstr "LHF 程序可使用以下选项："

msgid "``ORB`` orbital record containing previous orbitals (mandatory)"
msgstr "``ORB`` 包含先前轨道的轨道记录（必需）"

msgid "``LHFFIT`` use density fitting to compute the exchange matrix"
msgstr "``LHFFIT`` 使用密度拟合计算交换矩阵"

msgid "``POT`` record in which to write the local exchange potential"
msgstr "``POT`` 用于写入局域交换势的记录"

msgid ""
"``RESTART`` recompute the LHF orbitals and orbital energies from an already "
"computed exchange potential"
msgstr "``RESTART`` 从已计算的交换势重新计算LHF轨道和轨道能量"

msgid ""
"``SLA`` if set to 2, compute the Slater potential with the method described "
"in appendix A in Ref. [1] (default: 1)"
msgstr "``SLA`` 如果设为2，则使用参考文献[1]附录A中描述的方法计算Slater势（默认值：1）"

msgid "``BLOCK`` batch size for numerical grid"
msgstr "``BLOCK`` 数值网格的批处理大小"

msgid ""
"``PUNCH`` if set to 1, the Slater potential and the response potential will "
"be written to the files ’slater.dat’ and ’response.dat’ (names can be "
"changed by setting the variables SLATER and RESPONSE in the Molpro input "
"file before calling the LHF program). The ’response.dat’ file will also "
"contain the total exchange potential. The default is to not punch out the "
"potentials."
msgstr ""
"``PUNCH`` "
"如果设为1，Slater势和响应势将被写入文件'slater.dat'和'response.dat'（文件名可通过在调用LHF程序前于Molpro输入文件中设置变量SLATER和RESPONSE来更改）。'response.dat'文件也将包含总交换势。默认不输出这些势。"

msgid ""
"``DAMP`` scale the response potential by "
":math:`\\rho/(\\rho+\\mathrm{damp})` in order to force the potential to "
"decay more rapidly in the asymptotic range (typical value "
":math:`\\mathrm{damp}=1d-5`). Not used by default, but can be helpful in "
"cases where the convergence of the KS calculation is slow."
msgstr ""
"``DAMP`` 将响应势按 :math:`\\rho/(\\rho+\\mathrm{damp})` 缩放，以迫使势在渐近区域衰减更快（典型值 "
":math:`\\mathrm{damp}=1d-5`\\ ）。默认不使用，但在KS计算收敛缓慢的情况下可能有帮助。"

msgid ""
"To significantly speed up the computation of the Slater potential "
"contribution, the density-fitting method of Ref. [2] can be used. It is "
"automatically switched to if a density-fitted KS calculation is performed:"
msgstr "为了显著加快 Slater 势贡献的计算，可以使用文献 [2] 中的密度拟合方法。如果执行了密度拟合 KS 计算，则会自动切换到该方法："

msgid ""
"Note, however, that now an additional auxiliary basis set with the name "
"DFLHF needs to be added in the basis input section which, e.g.:"
msgstr "但请注意，现在需要在基组输入部分添加一个名为 DFLHF 的额外辅助基组，例如："

msgid ""
"Notice that the use of the underlying JKFit basis sets that correspond to "
"the given orbital basis set are most suitable, because the fitting is "
"performed for products of two occupied molecular orbitals. Moreover, note "
"that **no contracted auxiliary basis sets** can be used with the DF-LHF "
"program."
