msgstr "``BJM`` 采用 Becke-Johnson 阻尼的修订版 DFT-D3。"

msgid "``CNTHR`` Neglect threshold in Bohr for CN (default=40)."
msgstr "``CNTHR`` CN 的忽略阈值（以玻尔为单位，默认值=40）。"

msgid ""
"``CUTOFF`` Neglect threshold in Bohr for :math:`E_{\\text{disp}}`, "
"(default=95)."
msgstr "``CUTOFF`` :math:`E_{\\text{disp}}` 的忽略阈值（以玻尔为单位，默认值=95）。"

msgid "The DFT-D4 program (``disp,d4``) accepts the options:"
msgstr "DFT-D4 程序（\\ ``disp,d4``\\ ）接受以下选项："

msgid "``CHRG`` Molecular charge."
msgstr "``CHRG`` 分子电荷。"

msgid "``S6`` Scaling factor for leading order term."
msgstr "``S6`` 主导项的标度因子。"

msgid "``S8`` Scaling factor for :math:`C_8` dependent term."
msgstr "``S8`` :math:`C_8` 相关项的标度因子。"

msgid "``S9`` Scaling factor for :math:`C_9` dependent term."
msgstr "``S9`` :math:`C_9` 相关项的标度因子。"

msgid "``A1`` Parameter in Becke-Johnson damping function."
msgstr "``A1`` Becke-Johnson 阻尼函数中的参数。"

msgid "``A2`` Parameter in Becke-Johnson damping function."
msgstr "``A2`` Becke-Johnson 阻尼函数中的参数。"

msgid "``GRAD`` Calculate gradient if ``LMBD=0``\\ :math:`\\ne 0`."
msgstr "``GRAD`` 如果 ``LMBD=0``\\ :math:`\\ne 0`\\ ，则计算梯度。"

msgid "``HESS`` Calculate hessian (currently not used in Molpro)."
msgstr "``HESS`` 计算 Hessian 矩阵（目前在 Molpro 中未使用）。"

msgid ""
"``PRINT`` Set print level (always highest is set automatically with "
"dispcorr4 command)."
msgstr "``PRINT`` 设置打印级别（dispcorr4 命令会自动设置为最高级别）。"

msgid "``G_A`` Charge scale height."
msgstr "``G_A`` 电荷尺度高度。"

msgid "``G_C`` Charge scale steepness."
msgstr "``G_C`` 电荷尺度陡度。"

msgid "``REFQ`` Kind of charge model."
msgstr "``REFQ`` 电荷模型类型。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the D2, D3 or D4 dispersion corrections can also be "
"calculated separately from the DFT calculation using the following template:"
msgstr "或者，也可以使用以下模板将 D2、D3 或 D4 色散校正与 DFT 计算分开计算："

msgid "using ``dispcorr3`` for DFT-D3 or ``dispcorr4`` for DFT-D4."
msgstr "使用 ``dispcorr3`` 进行 DFT-D3 或 ``dispcorr4`` 进行 DFT-D4 计算。"

msgid ""
"The older DFT-D1 [1] or DFT-D2 [2] dispersion corrections by Grimme can be "
"calculated by using the input"
msgstr "Grimme 提出的较早的 DFT-D1 [1] 或 DFT-D2 [2] 色散校正可以通过使用以下输入进行计算"

msgid "with the following options to ``dispcorr``:"
msgstr "``dispcorr`` 的选项如下："

msgid ""
"``MODE`` Adjusts the parametrisation used: ``MODE=1`` uses parameters from "
"Ref. [1] and ``MODE=2`` uses parameters from Ref. [2] (default: ``MODE=1``)"
msgstr ""
"``MODE`` 调整所使用的参数化方案：\\ ``MODE=1`` 使用参考文献 [1] 的参数，\\ ``MODE=2`` 使用参考文献 [2] "
"的参数（默认值：\\ ``MODE=1``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``A`` Parameter ``a`` in the damping function of Chai et al., see Ref. [5]"
msgstr "``A`` Chai 等人阻尼函数中的参数 ``a``\\ ，参见参考文献 [5]"

msgid "``GRAD`` Calculate gradient if ``GRAD>0``"
msgstr "``GRAD`` 如果 ``GRAD>0`` 则计算梯度"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_6^{ij}&=&2\\frac{C_6^i C_6^j}{C_6^i + C_6^j} \\qquad \\text{(Ref.\\ [1])}\\\\\n"
"C_6^{ij}&=&\\sqrt{C_6^i C_6^j} \\qquad \\text{(Ref.\\ [2])}\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_6^{ij}&=&2\\frac{C_6^i C_6^j}{C_6^i + C_6^j} \\qquad \\text{(Ref.\\ [1])}\\\\\n"
"C_6^{ij}&=&\\sqrt{C_6^i C_6^j} \\qquad \\text{(Ref.\\ [2])}\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"Major changes in the D3 and D4 dispersion corrections compared to D2 are:"
msgstr "D3 和 D4 色散校正相较于 D2 的主要变化包括："

msgid ""
"The hybridisation states of the atoms are taken into account in the "
"evaluation of the dispersion coefficients [3]."
msgstr "在色散系数的评估中考虑了原子的杂化状态 [3]。"

msgid ""
"The dispersion coefficients are dependent on local atomic charges obtained "
"from a self-consistent tight-binding calculation [4]. Many-body interactions"
" can be taken into account additionally."
msgstr "色散系数依赖于从自洽紧束缚计算获得的局部原子电荷 [4]。此外，还可以考虑多体相互作用。"

msgid ""
"Gradient contributions from the D3 and D4 dispersion correction are "
"automatically computed in DFT geometry optimisations."
msgstr "在DFT几何优化中，D3和D4色散校正的梯度贡献会自动计算。"

msgid "Nonlocal DFT (NLDFT)"
msgstr "非局域DFT (NLDFT)"

msgid ""
"The deficiency of standard DFT functionals to describe long-range "
"correlation energies (a.k.a. dispersion interactions) can be corrected "
"through a double-Hirshfeld partitioning of the correlation functional energy"
" density, using different weight functions :math:`w_A` and "
":math:`\\widetilde{w}_A` for the local (:math:`A=B`) and nonlocal "
"(:math:`A\\ne B`) terms (:math:`A,B`: atom indices):"
msgstr ""
"标准 DFT 泛函在描述长程关联能（即色散相互作用）方面的不足，可以通过对相关泛函能量密度进行双 Hirshfeld 划分来校正，其中对局域项（\\ "
":math:`A=B`\\ ）和非局域项（\\ :math:`A\\ne B`\\ ）使用不同的权重函数 :math:`w_A` 和 "
":math:`\\widetilde{w}_A`\\ （\\ :math:`A,B`\\ ：原子指标）："

msgid ""
"At the end of a NLDFT calculation the atom-atom decomposition of the "
"correlation energy as well as the sum of the local and nonlocal correlation "
"energy terms are printed. Furthermore, the sum of atom-atom contributions "
"for which :math:`R_{AB}<3.0` and :math:`R_{AB}<6.0` bohr are displayed."
msgstr ""
"在 NLDFT 计算结束时，会打印出相关能的原子-原子分解以及局域和非局域相关能项之和。此外，还会显示满足 :math:`R_{AB}<3.0` 和 "
":math:`R_{AB}<6.0` 玻尔条件的原子-原子贡献之和。"

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from the use of this method should acknowledge "
"Ref. [1] which describes the functional and analyses its performance for a "
"wide range of different benchmark data bases. In addition, Ref. [2], which "
"shows the performance of the NLDFT functional for describing the binding "
"energies of large supramolecular complexes, may be cited. The performance of"
" the NLDFT functional for geometry optimisations is investigated in Ref. "
"[3]."
msgstr ""
"所有使用此方法发表的成果都应引用参考文献 [1]，该文献描述了该泛函并分析了其在多种不同基准数据集上的性能。此外，可以引用参考文献 [2]，该文献展示了"
" NLDFT 泛函在描述大型超分子复合物结合能方面的性能。参考文献 [3] 研究了 NLDFT 泛函在几何优化方面的性能。"

msgid "References:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid "Fractional orbital occupation calculations"
msgstr "分数轨道占据计算"

msgid ""
"Spin-unrestricted UHF or UKS calculations, as well as RPA calculations, can "
"be done with fractional orbital occupation numbers. In particular, this "
"allows one to perform calculations with fractional electron numbers, useful "
"for example for analysing approximations (see Ref. [1])."
msgstr ""
"自旋非限制的 UHF 或 UKS 计算，以及 RPA "
"计算，都可以使用分数轨道占据数进行。特别是，这使得可以进行分数电子数的计算，例如用于分析近似（参见参考文献 [1]）。"

msgid ""
"Occupation numbers can be given separately for alpha and beta orbitals, "
"respectively, by using the following commands *before* calling the ``uhf`` "
"or ``uks`` program:"
msgstr "可以通过在调用 ``uhf`` 或 ``uks`` 程序\\ *之前*\\ 使用以下命令，分别为 alpha 和 beta 轨道指定占据数："

msgid "``FRACOCCA,<orbital_index>,<occupation_number>``"
msgstr "``FRACOCCA,<orbital_index>,<occupation_number>``"

msgid "``FRACOCCB,<orbital_index>,<occupation_number>``"
msgstr "``FRACOCCB,<orbital_index>,<occupation_number>``"

msgid ""
"where ``orbital_index`` is the index of the orbital in the order used for "
"constructing the density matrix, and ``occupation_number`` is the occupation"
" number of this orbital between 0 and 1. These commands can be repeated in "
"case of several fractionally occupied orbitals. When specifying the charge "
"and the wave function, all fractionally occupied orbitals must be considered"
" as occupied orbitals."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``orbital_index`` 是轨道在用于构建密度矩阵的顺序中的索引，\\ ``occupation_number`` 是该轨道在 0 到 "
"1 之间的占据数。对于多个分数占据轨道，可以重复使用这些命令。在指定电荷和波函数时，所有分数占据轨道都必须被视为占据轨道。"

msgid ""
"Example of a PBE calculation on the fractional C cation with 5.3 electrons:"
msgstr "在具有 5.3 个电子的分数 C 阳离子上进行 PBE 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Example of a RSH calculation on the fractional CO anion with 14.8 electrons:"
msgstr "在具有 14.8 个电子的分数 CO 阴离子上进行 RSH 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Example of a HF calculation on the H atom with 0.5 alpha electron and 0.5 "
"beta electron:"
msgstr "在具有 0.5 个 alpha 电子和 0.5 个 beta 电子的 H 原子上进行 HF 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Subsequent RPA correlation calculations (see `here <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#random-phase-approximation-rpatddft-program>`__) "
"will be automatically done with fractional orbital occupation numbers."
msgstr ""
"后续的RPA关联计算（参见\\ `此处 <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#random-"
"phaseapproximationrpatddftprogram>`__\\ ）将自动使用分数轨道占据数进行。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following shows the use of both non-self-consistent and self-consistent "
"DFT."
msgstr "以下展示了非自洽和自洽DFT的使用。"

msgid ""
"**``RKS`` or ``RKS-SCF``** calls the spin-restricted Kohn-Sham program. "
"``KS`` and ``KS-SCF`` are aliases for ``RKS``."
msgstr ""
"**``RKS`` 或 ``RKS-SCF``** 调用自旋限制的 Kohn-Sham 程序。\\ ``KS`` 和 ``KS-SCF`` 是 "
"``RKS`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"**``UKS`` or ``UKS-SCF``** calls the spin-unrestricted Kohn-Sham program"
msgstr "**``UKS`` 或 ``UKS-SCF``** 调用自旋非限制的 Kohn-Sham 程序"

msgid "*command, key1, key2, key3, :math:`\\ldots`*, *options*"
msgstr "*command, key1, key2, key3, :math:`\\ldots`*, *options*"

msgid ""
"Density fitting can be used for closed and open-shell spin-restricted KS and"
" is invoked by a prefix ``DF-`` (``DF-KS`` or ``DF-RKS``, see section "
":doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>`). For UKS, only Coulomb fitting is "
"possible (``CF-UKS``). Density fitting is highly recommended (unless "
"explicit symmetry handling is required), as the induced errors are "
"negligible and it offers *massive* speed increases, particularly for pure "
"functionals. For details see R. Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, and Peter "
"J. Knowles, *Fast Hartree-Fock theory using local density fitting "
"approximations*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004). "
"**All publications resulting from DF-HF or DF-KS calculations should cite "
"this work.**"
msgstr ""
"闭壳层和开壳层的自旋限制 KS 计算均可使用密度拟合，通过前缀 ``DF-`` 调用（\\ ``DF-KS`` 或 ``DF-RKS``\\ ，参见 "
":doc:`密度拟合 <density_fitting>` 一节）。对于 UKS，只能进行 Coulomb 拟合（\\ ``CF-UKS``\\ "
"）。强烈建议使用密度拟合（除非需要显式处理对称性），因为其引入的误差可以忽略不计，而且能带来\\ *巨大*\\ 的速度提升，对纯泛函尤为如此。详见 R."
" Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, and Peter J. Knowles, *Fast Hartree-Fock "
"theory using local density fitting approximations*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004)。\\ "
"**所有基于 DF-HF 或 DF-KS 计算发表的论文都应引用该文献。**"

msgid ""
"Normally, sensible defaults are used to define the integration grid. The "
"accuracy can be controlled using options as described in section `options "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#options>`__ or directives as described "
"in section `directives <the_density_functional_program.html#directives>`__. "
"More control is provided by the ``GRID`` command, as described in section "
"`numerical integration grid control (GRID) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__. **It is recommended to use tighter grid thresholds than those set "
"by default in Molpro if meta-GGA type functionals are used in the "
"calculation, see also `J. Chem. Phys. 157, 234106 (2022) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0119622>`__ where the accuracy of different DFT "
"quadrature grids is analysed for different functionals!**"
msgstr ""
"通常使用合理的默认值来定义积分网格。可以通过 `选项 <the_density_functional_program.html#options>`__ "
"一节所述的选项或 `指令 <the_density_functional_program.html#directives>`__ "
"一节所述的指令来控制精度。\\ ``GRID`` 命令提供了更多控制，见 `数值积分网格控制（GRID） "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__ 一节。\\ **如果在计算中使用 meta-GGA 类型泛函，建议使用比 Molpro 默认设置更严格的网格阈值，另见 `J. "
"Chem. Phys. 157, 234106 (2022) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0119622>`__，其中分析了不同 DFT 求积网格对不同泛函的精度！**"

msgid ""
"**``GRIDTHR``\\ =\\ *target*** Specifies the grid target accuracy (per "
"atom). The default is 1.d-6 unless this has been modified using a global "
"``THRESH, GRID`` option."
msgstr ""
"**``GRIDTHR``\\=\\ *\\ target*** 指定网格目标精度（每个原子）。默认值为 1.d-6，除非已通过全局 ``THRESH,"
" GRID`` 选项进行了修改。"

msgid ""
"**``COARSEGRID`` (logical)** If *true*, perform initial iterations with a "
"coarser grid. Default is *false*."
msgstr "**``COARSEGRID``（逻辑型）** 若为 *true*\\ ，则使用较粗的网格进行初始迭代。默认为 *false*\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``GRIDMAX``\\ =\\ *gridmax*** In the initial iterations, the grid accuracy"
" is min(*gridmax, target\\*coarsefac*) (only if COARSEGRID is set)."
msgstr ""
"**``GRIDMAX``\\=\\ *\\ gridmax*** 在初始迭代中，网格精度为 min(*\\ gridmax, "
"target\\*coarsefac*)（仅当设置了 COARSEGRID 时）。"

msgid ""
"**``COARSEFAC``\\ =\\ *coarsefac*** Factor for initial grid accuracy (see "
"above). The default is 1000."
msgstr "**``COARSEFAC``\\=\\ *\\ coarsefac*** 初始网格精度的因子（见上文）。默认值为 1000。"

msgid ""
"**``GRIDGRAD``\\ =\\ *0 or 1*** Defines whether grid weight derivatives are "
"included in analytical gradient calculations (default: 0). Disabling these "
"can improve convergence in geometry optimizations."
msgstr ""
"**``GRIDGRAD``\\=\\ *\\ 0 或 1*** "
"定义在解析梯度计算中是否包含网格权重导数（默认：0）。禁用这些导数可以改善几何优化中的收敛。"

msgid ""
"**``DFTFAC``\\ =\\ ``[``\\ *fac1,fac2,..*\\ ``]``** Factors for each "
"functional. The number of given values must agree with the number of "
"functionals."
msgstr ""
"**``DFTFAC``\\=\\ ``[``\\ *\\ fac1,fac2,..\\ *\\ ``]``** "
"各泛函的因子。所给数值的个数必须与泛函的个数一致。"

msgid ""
"**``EXFAC``\\ =\\ *factor*** Fraction of exact exchange added to the "
"functional. The default depends on the functional."
msgstr "**``EXFAC``\\=\\ *\\ factor*** 加入泛函中的精确交换所占比例。默认值取决于泛函。"

msgid ""
"**``TOLORB``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for orbital screening (default "
"depends on energy threshold)."
msgstr "**``TOLORB``\\=\\ *\\ value*** 轨道筛选阈值（默认值取决于能量阈值）。"

msgid ""
"The following options may be used to control the operation of the DFT "
"modules. In the Kohn-Sham case, these may come in any order before or after "
"directives for the SCF program as described in Section :doc:`the SCF program"
" <the_scf_program>`."
msgstr ""
"以下选项可用于控制 DFT 模块的运行。在 Kohn-Sham 情形下，它们可以按任意顺序放在 :doc:`SCF 程序 "
"<the_scf_program>` 一节所述的 SCF 程序指令之前或之后。"

msgid "``DENSITY,orbc.filec,$\\dots$ ODENSITY,orbo.fileo,$\\dots$``"
msgstr "``DENSITY,orbc.filec,$\\dots$ ODENSITY,orbo.fileo,$\\dots$``"

msgid "``DFTTHRESH,key1=value1,key2=value2$\\ldots$``"
msgstr "``DFTTHRESH,key1=value1,key2=value2$\\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"``TOTAL`` Overall target accuracy (per atom) of density functional. Defaults"
" to the value of the global threshold command:gthresh ``GRID`` or the value "
"specified by option ``GRID``. For proper use of this threshold, other "
"thresholds should be left at their default value of zero."
msgstr ""
"``TOTAL`` 密度泛函的总体目标精度（每个原子）。默认取全局阈值命令:gthresh ``GRID`` 的值，或选项 ``GRID`` "
"所指定的值。为了正确使用该阈值，其他阈值应保持其默认值零。"

msgid "``EXCHANGE,factor``"
msgstr "``EXCHANGE,factor``"

msgid "``DFTFACTOR,fac1, fac2, ...``"
msgstr "``DFTFACTOR,fac1, fac2, ...``"

msgid "``DH, ax, ac``"
msgstr "``DH, ax, ac``"

msgid ""
"initiates a double-hybrid calculation (Ref. [1]) where :math:`a_x` is the "
"fraction of HF exchange and :math:`a_c` is the fraction of MP2 correlation. "
"A self-consistent KS calculation is performed with functional :math:`a_x "
"E_x^{\\text{HF}} + (1-a_x) E_x^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] + (1-a_c) "
"E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho]`. One then needs to call the MP2 program to add the"
" MP2 contribution :math:`a_c E_c^{\\text{MP2}}`. If :math:`a_c` is not "
"given, :math:`a_c=a_x^2` is assumed, according to Ref. [2]. ``DSDH, ax, ac``"
msgstr ""
"启动双杂化计算（文献 [1]），其中 :math:`a_x` 为 HF 交换所占比例，\\ :math:`a_c` 为 MP2 相关所占比例。首先用泛函"
" :math:`a_x E_x^{\\text{HF}} + (1-a_x) E_x^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho] + (1-a_c) "
"E_c^{\\text{DFT}}[\\rho]` 进行自洽 KS 计算，然后需要调用 MP2 程序以加入 MP2 贡献 :math:`a_c "
"E_c^{\\text{MP2}}`\\ 。若未给出 :math:`a_c`\\ ，则按照文献 [2] 假定 :math:`a_c=a_x^2`\\ "
"。\\ ``DSDH, ax, ac``"

msgid ""
"Example of input for B2-PLYP calculation (Ref. [1]): "
"``{ks,b,lyp;dh,0.53,0.27;}\\\\`` ``mp2,ksfock;``"
msgstr "B2-PLYP 计算的输入示例（文献 [1]）：\\ ``{ks,b,lyp;dh,0.53,0.27;}\\\\`` ``mp2,ksfock;``"

msgid ""
"Note that the option ``ksfock`` needs to be added to the ``mp2`` command "
"which will choose the KS hamiltonian instead of the Fock matrix as "
":math:`H_0` in the MP2 program. This affects only the denominators used in "
"the second-order correlation energy terms. Additional singles contributions "
"that would enter with ``ksfock`` due to the violation of Brillouin's theorem"
" are not computed in the closed-shell MP2 program."
msgstr ""
"注意，需要在 ``mp2`` 命令中加入选项 ``ksfock``\\ ，这样 MP2 程序中将选用 KS 哈密顿量而非 Fock 矩阵作为 "
":math:`H_0`\\ 。这只影响二阶相关能项中所用的分母。由于违反布里渊定理，使用 ``ksfock`` 时本会出现的额外单激发贡献在闭壳层 "
"MP2 程序中不予计算。"

msgid ""
"Example of input for 1DH-BLYP calculation (Ref. [2]): "
"``{ks,b,lyp;dh,0.65;}\\\\`` ``mp2,ksfock;``"
msgstr "1DH-BLYP 计算的输入示例（文献 [2]）：\\ ``{ks,b,lyp;dh,0.65;}\\\\`` ``mp2,ksfock;``"

msgid ""
"Example of input for DS1DH-TPSS calculation (Ref. [3]): "
"``{ks,tpss;dsdh,0.725;}\\\\`` ``mp2.ksfock;``"
msgstr "DS1DH-TPSS 计算的输入示例（文献 [3]）：\\ ``{ks,tpss;dsdh,0.725;}\\\\`` ``mp2.ksfock;``"

msgid "``Unrestricted calculations (uks, ump2) can also be done.``"
msgstr "``Unrestricted calculations (uks, ump2) can also be done.``"

msgid ""
"References: :math:`[1]` S. Grimme, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2148954>`__ **124**, 034108 (2006). "
":math:`[2]` K. Sharkas, J. Toulouse, A. Savin, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3544215>`__ **134**, 064113 (2011). "
":math:`[3]` S. M. O. Souvi, K. Sharkas, J. Toulouse, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4865963>`__ **140**, 084107 (2014)."
msgstr ""
"References: :math:`[1]` S. Grimme, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2148954>`__ **124**, 034108 (2006). "
":math:`[2]` K. Sharkas, J. Toulouse, A. Savin, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3544215>`__ **134**, 064113 (2011). "
