msgid ""
"An atom dependent radial scaling factor can be set with the option "
"``RADIAL_SCALING``, e.g. ``RADIAL_SCALING``\\ =[1.0,1.1,1.1] could be a "
"possible modification of the radial grids for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O "
"``xcgrid.png?nolink&50``. Note that factors for all atoms must be given, "
"otherwise the option will be ignored. The option can also be used to modify "
"the scalar *scale* factor for ``dftgrid.png?nolink&50`` in which case only a"
" single value needs to be given that will then be used to scale the radial "
"grids for all atoms."
msgstr ""
"可以使用选项 ``RADIAL_SCALING`` 设置依赖于原子的径向标度因子，例如 "
"``RADIAL_SCALING``\\=[1.0,1.1,1.1] 可以作为 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O "
"``xcgrid.png?nolink&50`` 的径向网格的一种可能修改。注意，必须给出所有原子的因子，否则该选项将被忽略。该选项也可用于修改 "
"``dftgrid.png?nolink&50`` 的标量 *scale* 因子，此时只需给出单一数值，它将用于缩放所有原子的径向网格。"

