msgid ""
"**Important note regarding some functionals from LibXC that also are "
"available in Molpro's internal functional library:** A number of functionals"
" which are both available in LibXC and Molpro may give slightly different "
"results in total energies (in the micro hartree range for small molecules) "
"due to truncation of significant digits of underlying parameters. An example"
" for this is the PBE functional `https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.77.3865"
" <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.77.3865>`__ in which case the "
"implementation in Molpro uses parameters taken only from the PBE paper some "
"of which are truncated compared to the original source, see references in "
"the PBE paper. Compared to this, LibXC uses a more accurate representation "
"of the parameters in terms of significant digits, resulting to differences "
"in the micro hartree range. Such differences are unlikely to have any effect"
" on energy differences, such as reaction or atomisation energies, but should"
" be kept in mind when comparing total energies calculated with the Molpro "
"and LibXC functionals, respectively."
msgstr ""
"**关于 LibXC 中某些在 Molpro 内置泛函库中也可用的泛函的重要说明：**\\ 由于底层参数有效数字被截断，许多在 LibXC 和 "
"Molpro 中都可用的泛函在总能量上可能给出略有差异的结果（对小分子在微哈特里量级）。一个例子是 PBE 泛函 "
"`https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.77.3865 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.77.3865>`__\\ ，此时 Molpro 中的实现只使用取自 PBE "
"论文的参数，其中一些参数相对于原始来源被截断，见 PBE 论文中的参考文献。相比之下，LibXC "
"对参数使用了有效数字位数更高的表示，从而产生微哈特里量级的差异。这种差异不太可能对反应能或原子化能之类的能量差产生影响，但在分别比较用 Molpro "
"泛函与 LibXC 泛函计算的总能量时应当记住这一点。"

msgid ""
"Functionals known to yield slightly different results according to this:"
msgstr "已知会因此给出略有差异结果的泛函有："

msgid "= Note on MK00 and MK00B functionals"
msgstr "= 关于 MK00 和 MK00B 泛函的说明"

msgid ""
"A number of exact exchange Kohn-Sham methods are implemented in Molpro. "
"Here, in contrast to standard hybrid functionals, the functional derivative "
"of the exact exchange energy is taken with respect to the electron density: "
"\\begin{equation}"
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中实现了多种精确交换 Kohn-Sham "
"方法。这里与标准杂化泛函不同，精确交换能的泛函导数是针对电子密度取的：\\begin{equation}"

msgid ""
"\\end{equation} which yields a *local* exchange potential opposed to the "
"Hartree-Fock method in which the potential is nonlocal. Due to this, while "
"total energies from exact exchange KS methods are close to HF energies, "
"orbitals and orbital energies can strongly differ from each other. The "
"advantage of exact exchange KS methods is that the orbitals and orbital "
"energies can directly be used as input data for time-dependent DFT methods "
"employing local KS kernels for calculating response properties or excitation"
" energies, see also section `Time-dependent density functional theory "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#time-dependent-density-functional-"
"theory>`__. Moreover, orbitals from exact exchange KS calculations are also "
"suitable for use in DFT-SAPT calculations (section :doc:`symmetry-adapted "
"intermolecular perturbation theory <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory>`) because the local exact "
"exchange potential :math:`v_{\\text{x}}({\\bf r})` possesses the correct "
"asymptotic behaviour and thus yields an improved description of the "
"electronic density in the asymptotic range."
msgstr ""
"\\end{equation} 由此得到一个\\ *局域*\\ 的交换势，这与 Hartree-Fock "
"方法中势为非局域的情况相反。正因如此，虽然精确交换 KS 方法给出的总能量接近 HF 能量，但两者的轨道和轨道能量可能相差很大。精确交换 KS "
"方法的优点在于，其轨道和轨道能量可以直接用作采用局域 KS 核的含时 DFT 方法的输入数据，用于计算响应性质或激发能，另见 `含时密度泛函理论 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#time-dependent-density-functional-"
"theory>`__ 一节。此外，精确交换 KS 计算得到的轨道也适合用于 DFT-SAPT 计算（参见 :doc:`对称适应分子间微扰理论 "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory>` 一节），因为局域的精确交换势 "
":math:`v_{\\text{x}}({\\bf r})` 具有正确的渐近行为，从而能改善对渐近区电子密度的描述。"

msgid ""
"Since the exact exchange energy is only an implicit functional of the "
"density (through the direct dependency on the occupied molecular orbitals) "
"the functional derivative in Eq. \\eqref{eq:vx} can not be obtained by a "
"direct differentiation. Two different methods are implemented in Molpro by "
"which the local exchange potential can be computed, the LHF (Local Hartree-"
"Fock) method by Della Sala and Görling [1] and the Optimised Effective "
"Potential (OEP) method employing the auxiliary basis set implementation of "
"Ref. [5]. The two different approaches are described in the following "
"subsections."
msgstr ""
"由于精确交换能只是密度的隐式泛函（通过其对占据分子轨道的直接依赖），式 \\eqref{eq:vx} 中的泛函导数无法通过直接微分求得。Molpro "
"中实现了两种可计算局域交换势的不同方法：Della Sala 和 Görling 的 LHF（局域 Hartree-Fock）方法 [1]，以及采用文献"
" [5] 的辅助基组实现的优化有效势（OEP）方法。以下两小节将分别描述这两种不同的方法。"

msgid ""
