"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1398093>`__ **115**, 5718 (2001) :math:`[2]` "
"A. Heßelmann and F.R. Manby, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2072887>`__ **123**, 164116 (2005) :math:`[3]`"
" A. Görling, A. Heßelmann, M. Jones and M. Levy, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2826366>`__ **128**, 104104 (2008) :math:`[4]`"
