msgid "van-der-Waals DF's"
msgstr "范德华 DF"

msgid ""
"Long-range correlation interactions can be described by so-called van-der-"
"Waals density functionals (vdwDF's) that are designed to correct the "
"qualitatively wrong asymptotic behaviour of the xc energy between two "
"noncovalently bonded systems. vdwDF's are clearly different to standard "
"density functionals in that they are defined in terms of a nonlocal integral"
" kernel :math:`\\phi({\\bf r}_1,{\\bf r}_2)`: :math:`E_c^{vdwDF}=\\int{\\bf "
"r}_1\\int{\\bf r_2}\\rho({\\bf r}_1) \\phi({\\bf r}_1,{\\bf r}_2) "
"\\rho({\\bf r}_2)` where :math:`\\phi` itself is a (nonlocal) function of "
"the density :math:`\\rho` and its derivative(s) :math:`\\nabla\\rho`. Due to"
" this, the integral can normally not be calculated analytically and requires"
" a double-space integration using numerical quadrature techniques."
msgstr ""
"长程关联相互作用可以用所谓的范德华密度泛函（vdwDF）来描述，其设计目的是校正两个非共价键合体系之间 xc 能量定性上错误的渐近行为。vdwDF "
"与标准密度泛函有明显不同：它们通过一个非局域积分核 :math:`\\phi({\\bf r}_1,{\\bf r}_2)` 定义：\\ "
":math:`E_c^{vdwDF}=\\int{\\bf r}_1\\int{\\bf r_2}\\rho({\\bf r}_1) "
"\\phi({\\bf r}_1,{\\bf r}_2) \\rho({\\bf r}_2)`\\ ，其中 :math:`\\phi` 本身是密度 "
":math:`\\rho` 及其导数 :math:`\\nabla\\rho` "
"的（非局域）函数。因此，该积分通常无法解析计算，需要使用数值求积技术进行双重空间积分。"

msgid ""
"vdwDF correlation energies can be calculated both non-selfconsistently, "
"calling the ``vdwDF`` program, and selfconsistently using the ``ks`` "
"program. An non-selfconsistent calculation for the VV10 functional by Vydrov"
" & Van Voorhis `https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3521275 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3521275>`__ would look like"
msgstr ""
"vdwDF 相关能既可以非自洽计算（调用 ``vdwDF`` 程序），也可以用 ``ks`` 程序自洽计算。使用 Vydrov 和 Van "
"Voorhis 的 VV10 泛函 `https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3521275 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3521275>`__ 进行非自洽计算的示例如下"

msgid ""
"``GTHR`` This can be used to alter the threshold for the grid accuracy. It "
"is particularly useful for larger systems where the double-space integration"
" becomes more expensive and where the integration (probably) need not be "
"highly accurate. Default: ``GTHR=<global grid threshold set in dft/ks>``."
msgstr ""
"``GTHR`` 可用于修改网格精度阈值。对较大的体系特别有用，因为此时双重空间积分变得更昂贵，而积分（可能）不必达到很高的精度。默认：\\ "
"``GTHR=<global grid threshold set in dft/ks>``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``NBLOCK`` Block size for grid batches. Default: ``NBLOCK=0`` which actually"
" means that no grid batching is performed at all (requiring more memory "
"consumption)."
msgstr "``NBLOCK`` 网格批次的块大小。默认：\\ ``NBLOCK=0``\\ ，这实际上意味着完全不进行网格分批（需要更多内存消耗）。"

msgid ""
"``B`` The ``B`` parameter from the VV10 functional that is functional "
"dependent. The program can detect a few number of functionals automatically "
"and sets the value of ``B`` to the optimised values determined by Hujo and "
"Grimme `https://doi.org/10.1039/C1CP20591A "
"<https://doi.org/10.1039/C1CP20591A>`__. The default value is ``B=5.9`` that"
" should be used in conjunction with the local ``GGA_XC_VV10`` functional "
"part."
msgstr ""
"``B`` VV10 泛函中依赖于具体泛函的 ``B`` 参数。程序能自动识别少数几种泛函，并将 ``B`` 设为 Hujo 和 Grimme "
"`https://doi.org/10.1039/C1CP20591A <https://doi.org/10.1039/C1CP20591A>`__ "
"所确定的优化值。默认值为 ``B=5.9``\\ ，应与局域 ``GGA_XC_VV10`` 泛函部分联用。"

msgid ""
"see the corresponding options to vdwDF above. The only new option in SCF "
"calculations is a print option that can be used to switch on ``print=1`` and"
" off ``print=0`` the printing of the VV10NL correlation energies during the "
"SCF. By default this is activated ``print>0``."
msgstr ""
"见上文 vdwDF 的相应选项。SCF 计算中唯一的新选项是一个打印选项，用于在 SCF 过程中开启（\\ ``print=1``\\ ）或关闭（\\ "
"``print=0``\\ ）VV10NL 相关能的打印。默认情况下该功能是开启的（\\ ``print>0``\\ ）。"

