msgstr ""
"\\begin{align} E_{\\text{c}}^{\\text{NLDFT}}[\\rho]=\\sum_{A}^{N}\\int "
"d{\\bf r} \\, w_{A}^{2}({\\bf r})\\, "
"z(\\rho,\\nabla\\rho,\\dots)+2\\sum_{A}^{N} \\sum_{B<A}^{N}\\int d{\\bf "
"r}\\,\\widetilde{w}_{A}({\\bf r}) \\widetilde{w}_{B}({\\bf r})\\, "
"z(\\rho,\\nabla\\rho,\\dots)\\label{eq:EcNLDFT} \\end{align}"

msgid ""
"The Hirshfeld weights :math:`w_A` of the local part of the correlation "
"functional (first term on the rhs in Eq. \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} are determined "
"by using analytical expressions for the atomic densities (:math:`\\rho_A`) "
"using Slaters rules. In contrast to this, the weights for the nonlocal part "
"of the correlation energy (second term on the rhs in Eq. \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT}"
" are determined by modified atomic densities using"
msgstr ""
"相关泛函局域部分的 Hirshfeld 权重 :math:`w_A`\\ （式 \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} 右端第一项）由原子密度（\\ "
":math:`\\rho_A`\\ ）的解析表达式按 Slater 规则确定。与此不同，相关能非局域部分的权重（式 "
"\\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} 右端第二项）则由按下式修正的原子密度确定："

msgid ""
"\\begin{align} \\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}({\\bf r}) & = & "
"\\mathcal{N}\\left(\\rho_{A}({\\bf r})+"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align} \\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}({\\bf r}) & = & "
"\\mathcal{N}\\left(\\rho_{A}({\\bf r})+"

msgid "\\end{align}"
msgstr "\\end{align}"

msgid ""
"with :math:`\\mathcal{N}`: normalisation constant, :math:`r`: distance from "
"nucleus and :math:`p_1,p_2,p_3`: parameters (see Ref. [1] for details). Due "
"to the :math:`1/r^{6}` long-range tail of the modified densities "
":math:`\\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}`, the atom-atom contribution to "
":math:`E_{\\text{c}}^{\\text{NLDFT}}` in Eq. \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} adapts to "
"the correct long-range behaviour of the correlation energy so that the NLDFT"
" functional, unlike standard DFT functionals, can describe dispersion "
"interactions, see Ref. [1]. Note that compared to the explicit damped "
"dispersion corrections described in section `empirical damped dispersion "
"correction <the_density_functional_program.html#empirical-damped-dispersion-"
"correction>`__ the NLDFT functional of Eq. \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} also "
"describes changes in the exchange-correlation potential due to the "
"modification of the correlation energy density."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\mathcal{N}`\\ ：归一化常数，\\ :math:`r`\\ ：到原子核的距离，\\ "
":math:`p_1,p_2,p_3`\\ ：参数（详见文献 [1]）。由于修正密度 :math:`\\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}` 具有"
" :math:`1/r^{6}` 的长程尾部，式 \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} 中对 "
":math:`E_{\\text{c}}^{\\text{NLDFT}}` 的原子对贡献能够适应相关能的正确长程行为，因此 NLDFT 泛函与标准 "
"DFT 泛函不同，可以描述色散相互作用，见文献 [1]。注意，与 `经验阻尼色散校正 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#empirical-damped-dispersion-"
"correction>`__ 一节所述的显式阻尼色散校正相比，式 \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT} 的 NLDFT "
"泛函还能描述相关能密度修正所引起的交换-相关势变化。"

msgid ""
"Since the densities :math:`\\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}` defined in Eq. "
"\\eqref{eq:RhoTilde} contain atomic parameters, calculations with the NLDFT "
"functionals should be carried out only for systems containing atoms which "
"were already parametrised, namely H, C, N, O, F, Si, P, S and Cl, see table "
"1 in Ref. [1]. Moreover, the NLDFT functional should (and can) only be used "
"in conjunction with the PBE correlation functional. For the exchange "
"functional part, the revised PBE exchange functional (with "
":math:`\\kappa=0.9`) from Ref. [1] should be used. NLDFT calculations can "
"then be done by adding the keyword ``nldft`` to the input for the Kohn-Sham "
"calculation:"
msgstr ""
"由于式 \\eqref{eq:RhoTilde} 中定义的密度 :math:`\\widetilde{\\rho}_{A}` 包含原子参数，使用 "
"NLDFT 泛函的计算应只针对包含已参数化原子的体系进行，即 H、C、N、O、F、Si、P、S 和 Cl，见文献 [1] 中的表 1。此外，NLDFT "
"泛函应该（且只能）与 PBE 相关泛函联用。交换泛函部分应使用文献 [1] 中的修订 PBE 交换泛函（\\ :math:`\\kappa=0.9`\\"
" ）。然后，在 Kohn-Sham 计算的输入中加入关键字 ``nldft`` 即可进行 NLDFT 计算："

msgid ""
"Note in this case that it is important to name the ``pbec`` functional first"
" in the list of functionals. This is necessary, because the xc potential "
"contributions from various functionals are accumulated during the "
"construction of the xc matrix while the NLDFT double-Hirshfeld decomposition"
" is to be done for the correlation energy functional only, see Eq. "
"\\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT}."
msgstr ""
"注意，此时在泛函列表中把 ``pbec`` 泛函放在第一位很重要。这是必要的，因为各种泛函的 xc 势贡献是在构建 xc 矩阵时累加的，而 NLDFT "
"双 Hirshfeld 分解只针对相关能泛函进行，见式 \\eqref{eq:EcNLDFT}。"

