msgid ""
"For DFT calculations, the implementation has only been done for the option "
"``matrix=0`` in the ``uks`` command. Furthermore, the option ``old`` must be"
" added to the ``uks`` command in order to redirect Molpro to the old "
"unrestricted SCF program (the setting of fractional occupations is not "
"available in the new SCF code)."
